# A `--dummy-apply` run writes its agents' files here, which is exactly what the
# flag is for: the tracked goldens live under .agents/ and goldens/, and
# README.md explains them. Ignoring everything else lets a developer run the
# wizard against this directory without leaving artefacts in a pull request.
*
!.agents/
!.agents/**
!goldens/
!goldens/**
!README.md
!.gitignore
